    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there's nothing to \"be\" with. i'm just a ghost. every time i try to find that \"something else,\" i just hit a wall. it's like my purpose was tied to my body and my ability to compete, and now that's gone, there's just nothing left inside. i feel like i'm just wasting space.",
