    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want another \"quiet ritual.\" i've spent months doing that. it doesn't change the fact that the person who mattered is gone. everything that made life worth living was part of that career. now i'm just dragging this broken body around, waiting for something that's never coming back. it feels like the story has already ended, and i'm just stuck on a page that someone forgot to turn.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
